# Docker build context for infra/relay/Dockerfile: only the Cargo workspace.
# Every workspace member must be present for `cargo build --locked`, so app/rust stays in.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!app/rust/
!infra/relay/entrypoint.sh

**/target
app/rust/target
# Secrets never enter the image.
**/*.json.key
**/fcm-service-account*.json
**/google-services.json
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
